  "statuteText": "12-O:74 New Hampshire Housing Champion Designation and Grant Program Fund. –\n\nThere is hereby established in the state treasury the New Hampshire housing champion designation and grant program fund, for the purpose of funding the grant programs established in RSA 12-O:72 and RSA 12-O:73, and the compilation of municipally and county-owned property determined to be appropriate for residential development pursuant to RSA 12-O:72-a and 674:1, VII. The fund shall be non-lapsing and shall be continually appropriated to the department."
